lmrs-container (0.1.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Join the container to a user-defined docker network via LMRS_DOCKER_NETWORK
    (default smart-assistant in the shipped environment template). Proxy
    registration on this fleet resolves through docker aliases on that shared
    network; a manual `docker network connect` did not survive the container
    recreation on restart, which is how the registration silently died.

